Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(routes): story history rules and cold deep links

Open pushes one in-app entry, Newer and Older replace it, close goes back only for in-app entries and otherwise replaces a cold deep link with /. A cold load records its entry, opens the dialog and travels to the stop once the museum is ready.

